Scope of this MIT license
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This license covers the QUADRA-authored material in this repository: the
framebuffer desktop shell (desktop/quadra-desktop.c), the initramfs init
script (rootfs/init), the installers (installer/), the build tools (tools/),
the brand artwork (assets/brand/, rootfs/usr/share/quadra-os/brand/) and the
documentation.

Third-party components bundled with QUADRA-OS keep their own upstream
licenses: the Linux kernel (GPL-2.0) and BusyBox (GPL-2.0). The 8x8 bitmap
font in desktop/font8x8.h is public domain. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

If you copy, fork or redistribute QUADRA-OS, you must keep this copyright
notice, this permission notice and CREDITS.md.
